    "product_category": "Hydraulic Cement",
    "product_description": "A fine powdered hydraulic cement manufactured by burning calcareous and argillaceous and/or other silica, alumina or iron oxide-bearing materials at clinkering temperature and grinding the resultant clinker. It is used in general construction work including building construction, concrete pavements, flooring and plastering.",
